            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Launchpad 0.3.12</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Horizontal page swipes now complete the full page slide before swapping pages, eliminating the mid-swipe jump.</li>
  <li>Page direction now follows the visual displacement for trackpad, wheel and mouse-drag paging.</li>
  <li>Vertical scroll mode uses a row-aligned viewport: whole rows only, no labels clipped at the window edge.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
